                        "entry_id": "f2b71cbd-2680-3d98-9111-21a4a9229d08",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Using two people."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "36ac07d6-e8bb-4b8b-8a43-be6b66441901",
                                "sense_id": "6f7fe397-3fe0-3978-8d2a-d8c4b14d4048",
                                "text": "Dinghies are designed to be sailed single-handedly or double-handedly, but some larger cruising dinghies may have room for four or more people on board."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "aa3bf5f4-2cbe-3309-af77-1d4c37c7e140",
                        "entry_id": "f2b71cbd-2680-3d98-9111-21a4a9229d08",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Using both hands at the same time."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b148fca9-75e6-428e-95d3-45fdc4106e70",
                                "sense_id": "aa3bf5f4-2cbe-3309-af77-1d4c37c7e140",
                                "text": "Working double-handedly also conserves your hands in large kneading strokes, for example when you are working on the adductors on the inside of the thigh."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ecc9a379-d4ce-361e-a56f-d28354121560",
                        "entry_id": "f2b71cbd-2680-3d98-9111-21a4a9229d08",
                        "glosses": [
                            "By means of two approaches or agents"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5612d82e-a0a3-4f15-a5e0-91d0732dcb68",
                                "sense_id": "ecc9a379-d4ce-361e-a56f-d28354121560",
                                "text": "I said I was writing my memoirs, a choppy musical dedicated to counterpoint, without the axes of time and place, collapsing in upon itself because the notes will inevitably run out, returning, elaborating, crisscrossing, double-handedly creating variations upon a theme."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d9ea422-0d07-447c-8b8f-4a7c7b86b3df",
                                "sense_id": "ecc9a379-d4ce-361e-a56f-d28354121560",
                                "text": "The combination of discontent and economic collapse brought about the revolution. It did not do so simply double-handedly."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6a50e418-29be-37ca-adce-9524ea18a956",
                        "entry_id": "f2b71cbd-2680-3d98-9111-21a4a9229d08",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Duplicitously or hypocritically."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
